iframe(width="560" height="315" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/NKY4qsr1a1o" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen)
.blurb SafeCup is an interactive lid that keeps your drink safe while out. Spend less time worrying and more time enjoying yourself.
    | Using Google Cloud Vision APIs we installed a little camera on a removable pint lid that scans and stores your driver's licence
    | and then allows you to scan your own face to lock and unlock your cup. This project attempts to provide a feeling of safety when
    | out at a bar, and the freedom to go dance or use the restroom and leave your drink unattended.


.grid(data-colcade="columns: .grid-col, items: .grid-item")
    .grid-col.grid-col--1
    .grid-col.grid-col--2
    .grid-col.grid-col--3
    - var idx = 1
    while idx <= 9
        .grid-item
            .grid-img
                img(src="imgs/"+idx+".jpg")
                - idx++
